          terminated on the bases set out below.
    16.3. The Subscription will automatically renew for an additional term of twelve months at the
          end of the then current Subscription period, and will continue to do so every twelve
          months thereafter, unless you opt out of this by following the procedure set out at clause
          16.5 below, in which case the Subscription will automatically terminate on the last day
          of your then-current Subscription period.
    16.4. RealVNC shall notify you via email at least seven days before the Subscription Fees for
          the renewed Subscription period become due, but the automatic renewal of the
          Subscription period is not conditional on any acceptance or other acknowledgment by
          you of this email.

